@JonkooTrades Expectations are $407.5M revenue and $0.63 EPS, options pricing a 23.22% implied move.

Bar is already set at the high end. Management signaled this on June 1 in a CFO departure filing: "both FY2026 net sales AND diluted EPS are expected to come in at the high end of prior ranges, supported by very strong agentic AI-driven customer demand." 

Need Q3 to beat that and Kash to give FY2027 color.
